    step 0
    date "2022-06-08T19:24:22Z"
    title "US lawmakers to introduce resolution condemning "
    description "U.S. Rep. Jamaal Bowman (D-N.Y.) spoke Wednesday, surrounded by other Democratic lawmakers and family members of the Buffalo supermarket shooting victims, about a resolution he would be introducing to condemn the &#34;Great Replacement Theory.&#34; &#10;&#10;The &#34;Great Replacement Theory&#34; was allegedly cited in a manifesto by the gunman in the Buffalo shooting, and is a conspiracy theory that says there is a plot to diminish the influence of white people in society. According to reports on the theory, believers say the goal is being achieved by immigration of nonwhite people and through &#34;simple demographics.&#34; &#10;&#10;Bowman said Congress must address both gun control and the root causes of hate. &#10;&#10;&#34;This (the theory) has spread and infected the minds of so many,&#34; Bowman said. &#34;It is a conspiracy theory used to stoke racially-motivated violence all around the world.&#34;&#10;&#10;House Speaker Nancy Pelosi also spoke at the news conference with Bowman, calling the theory harmful to both the country and democracy. &#10;The vote on the resolution is expected to take place later on Wednesday. &#10;&#10;For more info, please go to https://globalnews.ca/news/8838516/what-is-white-replacement-conspiracy-theory-buffalo-shooting/&#10;Subscribe to Global News Channel HERE: http://bit.ly/20fcXDc&#10;Like Global News on Facebook HERE: http://bit.ly/255GMJQ&#10;Follow Global News on Twitter HERE: http://bit.ly/1Toz8mt&#10;Follow Global News on Instagram HERE: https://bit.ly/2QZaZIB&#10;#GlobalNews"
    channeltitle "Global News"
