    description "Watch now on Apple TV: https://apple.co/2FcsC7W?mt=6&#38;at=11lxRE&#10;&#10;&#34;White Noise&#34; is the definitive inside story of the alt-right, following Richard Spencer, Lauren Southern, and Mike Cernovich as they ride a wave of racist ideas to viral fame. Even as the movement breaks into the mainstream, it fractures, leaving its leaders to grapple with backlash, infighting, and self-doubt. &#34;White Noise&#34; will premiere on Apple TV and Google Play in the U.S. on October 21st.&#10;&#10;Learn more here: https://www.theatlantic.com/white-noise-movie/&#10;&#10;Subscribe to The Atlantic on YouTube: http://bit.ly/subAtlanticYT"
