    title "Ben Shapiro Says Replacement Theory Is "
    description "TMR discusses the great replacement theory and what people like Ben Shapiro and Tucker Carlson are really afraid of. The Majority Report crew why illegal immigration is demonized and why it is crucial to the Right&#8217;s agenda of having a group of society stripped from rights that are inalienable to its citizens. &#10;&#10;Watch the Majority Report live Monday &#8211; Friday at 12 p.m. EST at http://www.youtube.com/SamSeder or listen via daily podcast at http://www.Majority.FM &#10;&#10;#MajorityReport&#10;&#10;SUPPORT the show by becoming a member: http://www.jointhemajorityreport.com/ &#10;&#10;Download our FREE app: http://www.majorityapp.com  &#10;&#10;Find TMR merchandise on our website:  http://www.shop.majorityreportradio.com &#10;&#10;Spread the progressive message! LIKE and SHARE this video or leave a comment to bring attention to the stories that matter to you. And SUBSCRIBE to stay connected with The Majority Report&#8217;s video content!&#10;&#10;Support The Majority Report by subscribing to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-3jIAlnQmbbVMV6gR7K8aQ &#10;&#10;Follow us on Social Media:&#10;Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/themajorityreport &#10;Facebook: http://facebook.com/MajorityReport &#10;Twitter: http://twitter.com/MajorityFM &#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/majorityreport.fm/&#10;&#10;The right-wing echo machine has already sort of geared up to push back on the fact that we had you know white supremacist murder spree over the weekend in buffalo and they are trying to argue that things like you know replacement theory and this and that these are all just boogeymen that are just created not really real. here&#8217;s Ben Shapiro trying to argue that you know replacement theory at least it's not being woke. hold on for one-second hold on I love the leap he takes here how is it that these great replacement theory purveyors- like I don't know hypothetically speaking like Tucker Carlson, how is it that they presume this replacement's going to take place it's not immigration what is it like what it what how is that going to happen?"
    channeltitle "The Majority Report w/ Sam Seder"
