    id 124
    name "131"
    label "VULFUKUf_ks"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-20T15:41:47Z"
    title " in 60 Seconds | Political Cartoons | Mark Fiore"
    description "Yet another racist mass-murderer has referenced &#8220;replacement theory&#8221; or the &#8220;great replacement&#8221; in his twisted manifesto. The 18-year-old in the horrific Buffalo Tops shooting repurposed much of the Christchurch, New Zealand shooter&#8217;s manifesto and appears to be equally enthralled with the white supremacist conspiracy theory.&#10;&#10;But wait, the conspiracy doesn&#8217;t just live in the dank basements of racist shooters &#8212; it&#8217;s also aired regularly by Tucker Carlson on Fox News. From there, the ridiculous &#8220;theory&#8221; has made its way to other prominent Republican politicians and pundits &#8212; and lo and behold, to the Republican base.&#10;&#10;This would just be another silly conspiracy to rile up the Republicans&#8217; lowest common denominator, except this particular lie can have immediate deadly consequences. (Although to be fair, the Covid &#8220;hoax&#8221; lies spread by the far right have also had very deadly consequences.)&#10;&#10;By the way, if you&#8217;ve been enjoying my cartoons, please consider supporting my work over on Patreon &#8212; where you can find sketches, exclusive audio and other goodies! https://www.patreon.com/markfiore&#10;&#10;Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/markfiore&#10;Website: http://www.markfiore.com/&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/markfiore/&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/MarkFiore&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Mark-Fiore-Animated-Political-Cartoons-94451707396/"
