    description "Great Replacement Theory | Ep.77&#10;This Week In White Supremacy we are back to the harsh reality of mass shooting and racism in America in the wake of the incident in Buffalo, NY. &#10;__________________&#13;&#10;&#128241; Subscribe and Listen to The 1HOOD Media Podcast HERE:&#13;&#10;Apple: https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/this-week-in-white-supremacy/id1586049116&#13;&#10;Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/43R8PzvEKZ2FYusjvQ7eoH&#13;&#10;Stitcher: &#160;https://www.stitcher.com/s?fid=609907 &#13;&#10;Castbox: https://castbox.fm/ch/3809081&#13;&#10;Deezer: &#160;https://deezer.com/show/2293572&#13;&#10;__________________&#13;&#10;Connect with 1HOOD Online &#13;&#10;https://blackpittsburgh.com &#13;&#10;The #1 online destination for news written by and for Black Pittsburghers&#13;&#10;https://www.1hood.org&#13;&#10;The Vanguard of Arts and Activism&#13;&#10;__________________&#13;&#10;Connect with 1HOOD on Social Media:&#13;&#10;YouTube: You&#8217;re already here &#8212; Subscribe.&#13;&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/1HoodMedia&#13;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/1hoodmedia&#13;&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/1hood&#13;&#10;__________________&#13;&#10;About The 1HOOD Podcast:&#13;&#10;This Week In White Supremacy is The 1Hood Podcast discussing the cultural effects and weekly injustices surrounding white supremacy; through intelligent, insightful commentary and often comedic conversations this podcast is geared towards adults who want to digest the latest news and events with humor and Hip-Hop.&#13;&#10;DISCLAIMERS: The views and opinions expressed during this presentation are those of the authors and do not necessarily reflect the official policy or position of 1Hood Media, 1Hood Power, and or its affiliates.&#13;&#10;We do not own the copyrights to the selected songs, audios and/or videos shared in this broadcast.&#13;&#10;This Week In White Supremacy is brought to you by the 1HOOD Media Network&#13;&#10;Explicit Language &#13;&#10;Parental Discretion is Advised&#13;&#10;TV-MA&#13;&#10;__________________&#10;Chapters&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:33 This Week w/Jasiri X&#10;4:15 Mass Shooting in Buffalo,NY &#10;7:15 Great Replacement Theory &#10;10:05 Buffalo Shooting Reactions&#10;14:42 Whiteness Says&#10;23:32 White Mental Health Excuses&#10;29:05 Tale of Two Cities&#10;32:07 Liz v. The GOP&#10;33:36 CNN Started It&#10;38:09 Finding Blackness&#10;42:08 Inter-Racialcide&#10;51:38 White Boy Whippins&#10;56:24 Preachin&#8217; Insurrection&#10;1:03:54 Black People Thoughts&#10;1:05:10 White Pages/Call To Action&#10;1:11:27 Outro"
