    step 0
    date "2021-04-11T10:29:28Z"
    title "Great Replacement"
    description "The Great Replacement, also known as the replacement theory, is a white nationalist conspiracy theory which states that, with the complicity or cooperation of &#34;replacist&#34; elites, the white French population&#8212;as well as white European populations at large&#8212;is being demographically and culturally replaced with non-European peoples&#8212;specifically Arab, Berber, South Asians and sub-Saharan Muslim populations from Africa and the Middle East&#8212;through mass migration, demographic growth and a European drop in the birth rate. This theory is popular among anti-migrant far-right movements in the West. Scholars have generally dismissed the claims of a &#34;great replacement&#34; as being rooted in an exaggerated reading of immigration statistics and unscientific, racist views."
    channeltitle "Wiki4All"
