    title "Great Replacement Theory Is Racist Fake News From Tucker Carlson - I Disprove It In This Vlog"
    description "Great Replacement Theory Is Racist Fake News From Tucker Carlson - I Disprove It In This Vlog&#10;&#10;Great Replacement Theory is the idea that the white population in America is being &#8220;replaced &#8220;.  Remember, that means &#8220;take the place of&#8221;.  In other words one must go away to make room for the other.  &#10;&#10;In this vlog I prove that&#8217;s not happening in America.  The American Population, which was 178 million in 1960, is 331 million as of 2020.   It has grown over time.   &#10;&#10;The American white population was 158 million in 1960; it was at 205 million in 2020.   It grew.   Black population was 18 million in 1960 then grew to 48 million in 2020.   48 million is no replacement for 205 million and remember the total American population grew to 331 million in 2020.  &#10;&#10;There&#8217;s no replacement going on.  The idea of Great Replacement Theory was started by racists who can&#8217;t analyze population data, and don&#8217;t want to because it shows they are lying.   Proving once again that racism is a mental illness that can cost you your career, life, and freedom.  Get psychiatric help as soon as possible.  &#10;&#10;And get Great Replacement Theory out of your head.  &#10;&#10;Stay tuned. SUBSCRIBE TO ZENNIE62 YOUTUBE HERE: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqtc118chzxCUJExjeWbeEA?sub_confirmation=1"
