oe-de-las-calles&#10;&#10;Check out Jamie&#8217;s podcast, The Antifada.&#160;https://www.patreon.com/theantifada, on&#160;iTunes,&#160;or at&#160;https://www.twitch.tv/theantifada&#160;(streaming every Monday, Wednesday, Thursday and Friday at 7pm ET!)&#10;&#10;Subscribe to Discourse Blog, a newsletter and website for progressive essays and related fun partly run by AM Quickie writer Jack Crosbie.&#160;https://discourseblog.com/&#10;&#10;Subscribe to AM Quickie writer Corey Pein&#8217;s podcast&#160;News from Nowhere.&#160;https://www.patreon.com/newsfromnowhere&#160;&#10;&#10;Follow the Majority Report crew on Twitter:&#10;&#10;@SamSeder&#10;&#10;@EmmaVigeland&#10;&#10;@MattBinder&#10;&#10;@MattLech&#10;&#10;@BF1nn&#10;&#10;@BradKAlsop&#10;&#10;The Majority Report with Sam Seder -&#160;https://majorityreportradio.com/"
